      "question_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">A novice swimmer wants to improve. Using the SMART principle, describe a suitable goal and explain why it is effective.</div><span class=\"q-marks\">(4)</span></div>",
      "question_image_url": null,
      "mark_scheme_html": "<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">A goal that is specific and measurable, e.g. to swim 100 m front crawl without stopping</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">with a time limit, e.g. within eight weeks</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">Achievable and realistic for a novice</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>\n<div class=\"q-line\"><div class=\"q-line__text\">A goal like this maintains motivation and allows progress to be monitored</div><span class=\"ms-codes\">(1)</span></div>",
